This is purely an administrative change to facilitate FAA Familiarization (FAA will only familiarize one serial number per serialized STC).
This project creates a new STC based on STC A-LSA09-003/D issue 2 for aircraft serial number 7187 only.
The change from STC A-LSA09-003/D issue 2 is as follows:
 Change of DAH and address: WAS: Elisen Technologies; IS: Elisen & associés inc.;
 WAS multiple serial numbers (7186 and 7187); IS: 7187 only;
 Revision of MDL;
 Revision of ICA;
 Revision of FMS

2019-01-08  eMail - TCCA LOI NIL

